X:1
T:17 Visa
O:Sweden
A:Jämtland
N:Efter Janne Johansson. Visan, som hade många versa, sjöngs i Kall redan på 1840-talet.
N:(After Janne Johansson. The song, which had many verses, was sung in Kall as early as the 1840s.)
N:"During the day in my work, you are in my mind.
N:If the nation where I rest, there you are in my dream,
N: Mon when I'm awake, who misses jogging then?
N: I miss that friend who can never jog then."
N:Really ? - RR
